step Rough Grinding Stone to 83
  zone Azeroth
  tip Rough Grinding Stone is green at 75 (yellow 45, green 65, grey 85): about 58 crafts to 83. Each takes 2 Rough Stone. Two Rough Stone a craft. Grinding stones are parts for later plans; the extras sell to vendors.
