step Big Black Mace to 250
  tip Big Black Mace is green at 247 (yellow 230, green 242, grey 255): about 11 crafts to 250. Each takes 16 Mithril Bar, 1 Black Pearl, 4 Shadowgem, 1 Solid Grinding Stone and 2 Thick Leather. Make the 11 Solid Grinding Stone first. Only about 11 crafts to bridge 247-250, but each wants four Shadowgems (about one Tin Vein in a hundred) and a Black Pearl: buy those at the Auction House unless your bags already hold them. Needs an anvil nearby. Shadowgem (44 for 225-300): Shadowgem turns up in about one Copper Vein, Tin Vein or Silver Vein in 100: buy it at the Auction House, or keep the ones you find while mining. Black Pearl (11 for 225-300): Black Pearl is a rare drop (no mob gives it one time in 50): buy it at the Auction House, or keep the ones you find.
  craft 9920 x11
  craft 10001 until 250

step Ornate Thorium Handaxe to 255
  tip Ornate Thorium Handaxe is orange at 250 (yellow 275, green 287, grey 300): about 5 crafts to 255, a point every craft. Each takes 20 Thorium Bar, 2 Large Opal, 2 Dense Grinding Stone and 4 Rugged Leather. Make the 10 Dense Grinding Stone first. Large Opal turns up in about one Thorium vein in 130: buy the ten at the Auction House. Five crafts only, until the battleaxe plans can be used at 255. Needs an anvil nearby. Thorium Bar (2026 for 225-300): Mining: smelt Thorium Ore; or the Auction House. Large Opal (10 for 225-300): Large Opal turns up in about one Rich Thorium Vein, Ooze Covered Rich Thorium Vein or Hakkari Thorium Vein in 143: buy it at the Auction House, or keep the ones you find while mining.
  learn 16969 -- from the recipe in your bags
  craft 16639 x10
  craft 16969 until 255

step Huge Thorium Battleaxe to 285
  tip Huge Thorium Battleaxe is orange at 255 (yellow 280, green 292, grey 305): about 31 crafts to 285. Each takes 40 Thorium Bar, 6 Dense Grinding Stone and 6 Rugged Leather. Make the 186 Dense Grinding Stone first. Plans from Magnus Frostwake (Caer Darrow, Western Plaguelands), unlimited stock, but they bind when picked up. Forty Thorium Bars and six Dense Grinding Stones a craft: the dearest stretch, so stop where the Imperial Plate Boots take over. Other ways through: world-drop plans from the Auction House (the Radiant pieces: about 820 Thorium Bars and 190 Hearts of Fire for the Radiant route) or the Merchant's Favor sets. Needs an anvil nearby.
  learn 16971 -- from the recipe in your bags
  craft 16639 x186
  craft 16971 until 285

step Plans: Imperial Plate Boots
  zone Tanaris
  tip Derotain Mudsipper (Tanaris) trades Plans: Imperial Plate Boots (Blacksmithing 270) for 40 Thorium Bar in Imperial Plate Boots, which needs Blacksmithing 265 and character level 50; take A Blue Light Bargain first (it asks for nothing). The plans bind when picked up.
