step Imperial Plate Boots to 300
  zone Azeroth
  tip Imperial Plate Boots is orange at 285 (yellow 290, green 300, grey 310): about 19 crafts to 300. Each takes 34 Thorium Bar, 1 Star Ruby and 1 Aquamarine. About 34 Thorium Bars a craft against the battleaxe's 40 and its grinding stones, orange to 290. Below character level 50 Derotain has no quest for you: keep making Huge Thorium Battleaxes to 300 instead (yellow to 292, grey at 305: about twice the Thorium Bars). Needs an anvil nearby. Aquamarine (19 for 225-300): Aquamarine turns up in about one Truesilver Deposit or Ooze Covered Truesilver Deposit in 500: buy it at the Auction House, or keep the ones you find while mining. Star Ruby (19 for 225-300): Star Ruby turns up in about one Truesilver Deposit or Ooze Covered Truesilver Deposit in 143: buy it at the Auction House, or keep the ones you find while mining. Blacksmithing 300 is a Legacy System milestone.
  learn 16657 -- from the recipe in your bags
  craft 16657 until 300
  skill Blacksmithing 300
